    ph_fact3_title:'OMR is Strong vs PHP', ph_fact3_desc:'The Omani Rial is one of the world\'s highest-valued currencies. Use the currency converter above for the live OMR to PHP rate before sending remittances home through Remitly, Western Union, or your bank.',
    ph_fact4_title:'No Income Tax on Salary in Oman (as of 2026)', ph_fact4_desc:'Oman does not levy personal income tax on salaries as of 2026. A tax law was passed in 2025 but implementation is expected from 2028 onwards. Note: Philippine income tax obligations depend on your OFW tax status — consult BIR rules.',
    ph_faq_title:'FAQ — Filipino OFWs in Oman',
    ph_faq1_q:'Do Filipino OFWs in Oman pay SPF deductions?', ph_faq1_a:'No. The Social Protection Fund (SPF) 8% deduction applies only to Omani nationals. Filipino OFWs keep their full gross salary with no SPF deduction from Oman. Note that SSS contributions in the Philippines are a separate obligation managed directly between you and SSS.',
    ph_faq2_q:'How is end-of-service gratuity calculated for Filipinos in Oman?', ph_faq2_a_html:'Under Article 61 of Oman Labour Law: 1 month basic salary per year of service, with partial years pro-rated. Example: 3 years at OMR 450 basic salary = OMR 1,350 gratuity. Use the <a href="end-of-service.html" style="color:var(--primary);">End of Service Calculator</a> for your exact figure.',
    ph_faq3_q:'Is there income tax on salary in Oman for Filipino workers?', ph_faq3_a:'As of 2026, Oman does not impose personal income tax on salaries. A law was enacted in 2025 but takes effect from 2028. Regarding Philippine tax: OFWs are generally exempt from Philippine income tax on their overseas earnings — consult BIR OFW guidelines for your specific situation.',
    ph_faq4_q:'What is the best way to send money from Oman to the Philippines?', ph_faq4_a_html:'Popular options include: Remitly, Western Union, bank transfers, and exchange houses. Compare rates and fees — the spread between rates can vary significantly. Use the <a href="currency-converter.html" style="color:var(--primary);">OMR to PHP Currency Converter</a> to see the live mid-market rate as a benchmark.',
    ph_faq5_q:'Does my POEA contract affect my gratuity in Oman?', ph_faq5_a:'Your POEA-standard employment contract and Oman Labour Law both provide protections. Oman Labour Law sets the minimum gratuity (Article 61), but your actual contract may offer better terms. If your contract provides higher gratuity or other benefits than the Oman law minimum, those terms apply. Always keep a copy of your contract.',
